# Copy to .env for local development. Gitignored.
#
# Gemini API key, used server-side only for capture verification.
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# With this UNSET the verify endpoint returns a stubbed "match" verdict and
# says stubbed:true, so the whole capture flow is testable without a key.
#
# For production do NOT use this file — promote it to a secret:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set GEMINI_API_KEY
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
